    {
      "id": 44,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Worker and service units",
      "description": "node_systemd_unit_state for the units that constitute Absurd on this guest \u2014 absurd-worker-default.service, absurd-worker-gpu.service and habitat.service \u2014 filtered to state=active, so 1 is running and 0 is not. Absurd has no engine process: these units are the engine, and a worker unit at 0 is why its queue is not draining.",
      "datasource": {
