      "description": "Seconds since each Absurd timer last fired, from node_systemd_timer_last_trigger_seconds: absurd-queue-metrics.timer feeds the queue-depth row and should stay under a minute or so, absurd-cleanup.timer runs hourly and a value approaching two hours means terminal-state rows are not being reaped. The count of units in state=failed on the whole guest is on the right axis and should be flat at zero.",
